      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>THE OBJECTIVE OF THE CARMEL MOUNTAIN RANCH LITTLE LEAGUE CMRLL SHALL BE TO TEACH THE CHILDREN OF THE COMMUNITY THE IDEALS OF GOOD SPORTSMANSHIP, HONESTY, LOYALTY, COURAGE, AND RESPECT FOR AUTHORITY. TO ACHEIVE THIS OBJECTIVE, CMRLL PROVIDES A SUPERVISED PROGRAM UNDER THE RULES AND REGULATIONS OF LITTLE LEAGUE BASEBALL, INCORPORATED. ALL REGULAR MEMBERS DIRECTORS, OFFICERS, PARENTS AND GUARDIANS AND PLAYER MEMBERS SHALL BEAR IN MIND THAT THE ATTAINMENT OF ATHLETIC SKILL OR THE WINNING OF GAMES IS SECONDARY, AND THE MOLDING OF FUTURE CITIZENS IS OF PRIME IMPORTANCE</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>THE MISSION OF CMRLL IS TO PROVIDE A HEALTHY ACTIVITY FOR CHILDREN USING THE BALL FIELD AS A CLASSROOM TO INSTILL DISCIPLINE, TEAM WORK, SPORTSMANSHIP AND FAIR PLAY, AND TO ESTABLISH A SET OF VALUES TO GUIDE THEM INTO ADULTHOOD.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
